eunen zijn opvattingen over duidelijke informatie, onderzoek en het toetsen van campagnes. Daarnaast behandelt hij verschillende media, direct mail en het werk binnen een reclamebureau. Het boek brengt vakinhoudelijke keuzes en zakelijke organisatie samen vanuit de ervaring en overtuigingen van een reclamemaker, zonder een universeel succesrecept te vormen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p842897763","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p842897763"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-044.json#72","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:08:04.723Z","note":"DavidOgilvy and DavidMackenzieOgilvy share exactViaf79032282/ISNI0000000109186153/Q198743 in independently bound KBperson and savedOLauthority. DutchPaperback9789021832586/JanSmit/Sijthoff is OgilvyOnAdvertising1983, not Confessions1963."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p842897763","https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/gdc/gdcfindingaidpdfs/ms012048/ms012048.pdf","https://www.boekwinkeltjes.nl/b/243510200/Ogilvy-over-reclame/","https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/124131/ogilvy-on-advertising-by-david-ogilvy/9780394729039/","https://ogilvy.relayto.com/e/ogilvy-on-advertising-dq85bunnm5ady","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL3346506W"],"review":"content-amendment-003.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL25898267M","isbn13":"9789021832586","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:08:04.723Z","note":"Bound bulk receipt reviewed once; no verifiedcoverassetretained. Hosted must record actualsameeditionfront or existingneutralplaceholder; no fallbacktoanotherlan